       'Validation checks film names, provenance, external links and contribution fields. All 76 source hashes match and all 24 query files execute in their appropriate graph mode. Fourteen tests and nine browser checks pass, covering endpoint behavior, Comunica, syntax errors, ASK, CONSTRUCT, IRI pages and mobile layout. Sixteen production query checks also pass. Eight public URLs are accessible without authentication; four checked RDF graphs are isomorphic to local graphs. HermiT and Pellet confirm consistency and no unsatisfiable named classes. OWL, Turtle and JSON-LD share millisecond timestamps. Tests and hashes do not establish the truth of every real-world claim.',
